=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Configure DNS ################################################$
$
# DNS Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Nameservers          192.0.2.54, 2001:db8::54$
   -  Search Domains       None$
   -  eth0 still uses its own nameserver 192.0.2.1$
$
   -  Set the nameservers$
      /etc/systemd/resolved.conf.d/zz-hardn.conf$
      @@ -0,0 +1,5 @@$
      +# Written by hardn: the system DNS servers for$
      | systemd-resolved.$
      +# An empty assignment resets the list that earlier files$
      | built.$
      +[Resolve]$
      +DNS=$
      +DNS=192.0.2.54 2001:db8::54$
      $ systemctl try-reload-or-restart systemd-resolved.service$
$
  Configure DNS? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$

